  <conditions attached="1">
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Before the first Disbursement of Program Funding for any grant award under the Women in Energy Grant Sub-Activity, MCA-Kosovo must provide evidence, in form and substance satisfactory to MCC, that it has developed and adopted an operational manual for awarding the grants.</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Before the first Disbursement of Program Funding for payment under a particular works or construction contract for the Energy Skills for the Future Activity, (A) MCAKosovo must have designed the training programs in form and substance satisfactory to MCC, and (B) the Government shall have provided evidence, in form and substance satisfactory to MCC, that it has initiated any necessary legal or institutional reform and committed to any financing arrangements necessary to facilitate effective implementation of the training programs.</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="2">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Before the first Disbursement of Program Funding for the JETA Project, MCA-Kosovo must develop and adopt in the M&amp;E Plan, Project Objective-level indicators with baselines and targets consistent with a cost-benefit analysis, in form and substance satisfactory to MCC.</narrative>
   </condition>
   <condition type="1">
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Further details on conditions precedent affecting this activity can be found in the top-level parent activities.</narrative>
   </condition>
  </conditions>
